<!--
  ATTIC.HTML — fragment only, no <html>/<head>/<body> tags.
  This gets fetched and injected into #atticRoot (in the main index.html) by Attic/attic.js.
  Do NOT open this file directly in a browser — it's not a full page.

  IMPORTANT: this fragment uses its own plain CSS classes (defined in attic.css),
  NOT Tailwind utility classes. Tailwind's CDN script only scans the page once on
  load and does not reliably pick up classes added later via fetch()-injection —
  so anything Tailwind-based in here would render unstyled. Style changes go in
  attic.css, section 2.

  SECTIONS IN THIS FILE (in order):
    1. FIRST-ENTRY REVEAL   — fullscreen dim/creak/light-flood sequence
    2. CONGRATS + SETUP MODAL — "You found it" + password/trigger setup
    (Future rooms/hub markup will be appended below as new sections, each
    clearly labeled the same way — paste new room HTML at the bottom.)
-->

